values ('ap_chemistry', 9, '9.1', array['9.1']::text[], 'convention', 'Entropy increases with temperature (energy dispersal)', 'Entropy increases when energy is dispersed: the distribution of kinetic energy among gas particles broadens as temperature rises, so the entropy of the system increases with temperature.', '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=task0067-chem-u5-u9-2026-10-10; candidate=ap_chemistry-u9-r1-002; ced=9.1.A.2 "the distribution of kinetic energy among the particles of a gas broadens as the temperature increases"')
