values ('ap_chemistry', 9, '9.11', array['9.11']::text[], 'list_sequence', 'Quantities related by Faraday''s laws', 'Faraday''s laws relate these quantities in the stoichiometry of a redox reaction in an electrochemical cell.', '[{"label": "i", "meaning": "Number of electrons transferred"}, {"label": "ii", "meaning": "Mass of material deposited on or removed from an electrode (as in electroplating)"}, {"label": "iii", "meaning": "Current"}, {"label": "iv", "meaning": "Time elapsed"}, {"label": "v", "meaning": "Charge of ionic species"}]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=task0067-chem-u5-u9-2026-10-10; candidate=ap_chemistry-u9-r1-024; ced=9.11.A.1 "Faraday''s laws can be used to determine the stoichiometry of the redox reaction"')
